  "description": "Get more from every ride\nOur full-power (600W), full-torque (85Nm) – all the time – ELyte EVO RS will help you make the most of your precious time, every ride: go farther, faster; enjoy more fun trails; hone your skills; explore further, and grow in confidence. With a full carbon frame, our lowest centre of gravity ever on a 29er eMTB for the finest, most capable handling, and the latest Bosch CX motor, ELyte EVO RS will inspire you with the very best mountain bike ride feel with full-power capability. All so you can get more out of every ride.\n\nHighlights\n– 150mm front + 142mm rear of custom-tuned suspension travel.\n– Uni-directional carbon fibre frame is light and reassuringly strong.\n– Bosch's new Performance Line CX lightweight, full-torque (85Nm), full-power (600W) motor.\n– 650Wh of combined battery (400Wh internal + 250Wh PowerMore range extender) so you can ride further.\n– 29er wheels front and rear for balanced handling.\n– 505.07mm complete bike centre of gravity for the best handling possible.\n\nComponents that perform ride after ride\nThe ELyte EVO RS is dressed in a curated parts list of trail-proven, real-world kit that performs out of the box and as well as for the long haul: RockShox Lyrik Select+ fork and Deluxe Select+ rear shock deliver exceptional rough terrain control; SRAM T-Type AXS 1x12 wireless electronic gearing, Maxxis tyres, feedback-rich SRAM Code Bronze four-piston brakes, and more. Our own custom-tuned suspension from RockShox has also been meticulously tuned to deliver you outstanding, ground-hugging grip with the support you need right from your first pedal stroke.\n\nCharge time: 50% in 1.5hrs from empty, and to 100% in 3.5hrs.\n\nELyte EVO RS: full-torque, full-power – all the time.",
